   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to enhance the work and procedures of the Lithuanian law enforcement authorities in the fight against narcotics. The specific goal is to improve the knowledge of the law enforcement authorities in specific skills e.g. conducting preliminary narcotic investigations, collecting and evaluating of evidence, international co-operation etc.</narrative>
